Comment: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:55.66,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:12.64,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.83,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, hand them separately!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:23.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:26.48,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Will we have a Tirol Christmas cake this year too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:27.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:29.00,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Santa will come, won't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:30.39,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:32.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Yuzuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.93,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Making sure we can fit a ton of presents under the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:36.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:47.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:50.91,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.67,0:02:36.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's Santa's outfit, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:40.32,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. Every year, Fujimoto acts as Santa for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:43.47,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,There's no one else who can do it besides me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:47.17,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose so. Then we'll be counting on you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:03:00.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if Fujimoto's mad at me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:02.36,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:03.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:05.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly, you know what else you need to be worrying about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:07.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:11.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Konpeito, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:13.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:16.46,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:21.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:22.29,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I waited for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.83,0:03:24.10,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You must be tired, working so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:26.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:31.22,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll walk you home... if that's okay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:35.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, um...! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:43.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everything sparkles during Christmas time, it's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:44.49,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.47,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, is there anything you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:49.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Anything I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:54.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Thanks to the bazaar, I've already gotten new toys...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:04:00.18,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then would it be okay if I picked out something that I think you'd like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:01.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:02.28,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,A present, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:04.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,For... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:06.93,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It is Christmas, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.72,0:04:10.23,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what would be good...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:21.66,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, hey! That must be tough, working during the Christmas holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:24.14,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.66,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter whether it's Christmas or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.09,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:30.64,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:33.49,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:35.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:42.09,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we go then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:43.96,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.47,0:04:53.18,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:57.03,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't made up with Kizokazu yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:02.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I... guess he really does hate me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:06.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's different than he usually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:09.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He hasn't bullied me at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:11.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and he won't meet my eyes anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:13.47,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:17.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I've been worrying about it for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.23,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:27.09,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Kiyokazu feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.35,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,He might not be able to say things so straight out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:34.52,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:38.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.43,0:05:44.87,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:48.70,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think I could see you tomorrow as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:49.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:53.45,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll wait for you in front of the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:56.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But... it's cold outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:57.88,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:00.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.22,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:06.37,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:09.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,See you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:16.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's Christmas-y inside too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:20.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I need to prepare a present for you too, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:21.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:24.22,Default,ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Konpeito! A bottle full of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:26.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:27.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:31.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I made this for you, Ioryogi! Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:37.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, you're now a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:43.13,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.81,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:03.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.10,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:10.55,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,You're earlier than usual this morning, aren't you, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:13.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'm going to help prepare for the Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:14.65,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:18.78,Default,C1,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, if you're not busy tonight, will you come over to our place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:20.47,Default,C2,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to have a Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:23.04,Default,C1,0000,0000,0000,,Mama's making a feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.44,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,If you're free, please do come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:38.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:39.43,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:42.00,Default,C1,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.52,Default,C2,0000,0000,0000,,Come to our Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.26,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I have work tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.81,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,But yeah, Christmas is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:49.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.44,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:53.33,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.75,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,All right... you two need to get going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:02.67,Default,C1,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:03.95,Default,C2,0000,0000,0000,,We'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:11.22,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:17.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's so happy because it's \NChristmas, but Fujimoto is still sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:23.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it's because I did something I shouldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.18,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:27.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:36.00,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu... became an orphan on Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:30.54,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:38.07,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:41.47,Default,Voice,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:46.36,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:48.37,Default,Voice,0000,0000,0000,,Good, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:35.10,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu's mother never came home again after that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:43.72,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,And then before long, he was taken in by Sayaka's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.59,0:11:14.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for being late!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:15.76,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:18.37,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let's start the Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:20.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm done changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:25.77,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Come in when we call for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:27.07,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:29.20,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:29.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:32.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Once you're ready, let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:46.43,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:51.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto is... amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:53.27,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He is, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:56.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's... amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:17.25,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:22.59,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,All right then, let's all call for Santa Claus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:24.15,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:26.65,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Santa Claus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.13,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.21,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,It's Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:32.31,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.59,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Santa's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:35.73,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:42.99,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Mr. Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:46.15,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's Santa Claus, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:49.83,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Santa, are you Mr. Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:53.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That person is Santa Claus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:57.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that right, Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:04.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,All right then everyone, what are you getting from Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:09.16,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Santa, did you bring presents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:11.01,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Can we have presents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:14.09,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:15.14,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:17.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much, Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:20.75,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,All right everyone, let's have some cake now, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:22.16,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.19,0:13:34.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps I'll go get a present too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.39,0:13:48.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Fujimoto, good job today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:54.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take care of the cleaning up, and it's \NChristmas after all... So why don't you—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.97,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:26.09,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez. Why do I have to—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:29.83,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Shut it. Christmas is the busiest time of the year!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:31.09,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Slavedriver...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:33.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:36.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.49,0:14:40.91,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You look pretty good in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:51.07,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:56.61,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:07.61,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:10.98,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,So Kiyokazu's shut himself off from the others because it's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:16.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It seems I've just... hurt him all the more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:22.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I made him hate me all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:24.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:28.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:31.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,does it hurt so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.39,0:15:45.69,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Does what happens to him bother you that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:50.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just can't help thinking about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:57.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't know why... \Nbut when I do, my chest hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:01.02,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:07.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:13.82,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I've finally realized what the perfect present is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.04,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's a Christmas present.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:34.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.52,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:36.47,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.11,0:16:40.16,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to take this to the lookout, to Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:43.79,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:44.93,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cover your job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:48.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:51.50,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it's Christmas, she looks so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:53.42,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And what does that—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:55.62,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,She's hurt because of your attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:17:04.63,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But she thinks it's her fault, and she said she wants to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.61,0:17:09.70,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,She's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:12.37,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,She's waiting for you, all by herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:11.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:13.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:17.44,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't done anything wrong, so \Nthere's nothing you need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:18.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.17,0:18:22.26,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,So why are you worrying so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:30.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... could this possible mean that you aren't angry with me, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.42,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I said that from the beginning, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:36.10,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're angry right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:43.09,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway... just don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:47.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:49.64,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:51.72,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,This is from Domoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:18:59.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you had made up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:05.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is my present to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:07.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry if he bullies you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:09.33,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:17.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto's present is... you, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:20.40,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What did Domoto say to you to make you wait here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:24.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He said, "I'm going to get the perfect present for you, so just wait here!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:33.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He gave me the chance to make up with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.18,0:19:36.39,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.41,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:42.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, it's snowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.53,0:19:44.63,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:05.78,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers that bloom in springtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.69,0:20:12.46,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,the endless skies of summer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:26.04,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,are both brilliantly engraved into my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:39.98,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even when it rains and the windows are closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:53.93,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,the overflowing light from my heart shines from above the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.89,0:21:02.84,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Happiness or sadness,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:09.33,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll embrace all of it and continue walking forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:16.79,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They are what so strongly connect...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:23.59,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,...my hands to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:14.42,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Snow is kind of pretty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:17.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:35.08,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Guide me, O voice, so far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:28.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what happens, when winter passes and spring arrives...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:32.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to say goodbye to Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:39.33,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like smiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.33,0:22:42.55,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like songs...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.55,0:22:49.53,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The resonating sound of the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.37,0:01:04.17,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:11.84,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:07.02,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:11.61,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:15.62,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.85,0:01:18.42,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:25.76,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:31.34,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:35.18,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.35,0:01:38.72,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:41.78,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:44.52,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:49.77,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:52.58,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:56.17,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:58.93,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:01.67,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.90,0:02:08.55,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:12.56,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:17.21,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
