Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:03:01.52,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\pos(365,195)\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}...White Christmas.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.54,0:03:01.52,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\pos(360,190)\bord1.6}...White Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.85,0:23:08.18,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Even though we all want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.64,0:23:15.42,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re being deceived by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:23.59,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}In reality, everybody can already fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.99,0:23:32.20,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}The reason why that child looks so sad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:43.17,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}might be because she left her shadow somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.68,0:23:45.86,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:50.43,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If telling you "Thank you",
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:54.40,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}or hearing "Thank you" just makes you smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.32,0:24:01.58,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}then doing those things will make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:06.20,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}And the{\fsp3}y{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}ll make you happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.60,0:24:15.03,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Do{\fsp1}n{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}t worry, w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.87,0:24:20.35,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}I{\fsp3}t{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}s mysterious as to why tears roll down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.93,0:24:28.17,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,1500)}even though {\fsp3}I{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}m happy.
